Not necessarily. Most veterans in this newsgroup think it may be best to
top your experience level at level 14 (the minimum required to do the
Quest), and raise your HP and Mana by other means (nurses, potions of
gain energy, ...).

Having a high experience level has one major drawback: the level of
generated monsters is determined by dungeon level *and* by your own
experience level.

Keeping your own level low will keep the monsters spawned easier.

